{"availability":"available","full":"Prot10/MyTripPlanner","name":"MyTripPlanner","description":"MyTripPlanner — self-hosted road-trip planner with Ulisse, the built-in AI travel agent. Real hotels, restaurants, maps, budget. Open source.","category":"Design","language":"JavaScript","stars":11,"forks":1,"created":"2026-07-02T17:15:31Z","updated":"2026-10-05T12:25:04Z","license":null,"branch":"main","homepage":"https://prot10.github.io/MyTripPlanner/","topics":["ai-agent","budget-tracker","directions","itinerary","javascript","leaflet","maps","mytripplanner","nominatim","open-source","openstreetmap","osrm","pwa","react","road-trip","tailwindcss","travel","travel-planner","vite","zustand"],"demo":"https://prot10.github.io/MyTripPlanner/demo/","color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-05T19:22:11.037Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-05T19:22:11.037Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-05T19:22:11.037Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-05T19:22:11.037Z","stars":11,"forks":1}],"technologies":["React"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Plan road trips by talking. Ulisse — an AI agent running on your own Claude or ChatGPT subscription — interviews you, then builds the whole itinerary live: stops, real roads on the map, timings, budget, real hotels from Booking.com and real restaurants from Google Maps.","[](LICENSE) []( []( []( [](#tech-stack) []( [](","Self-hosted · no API keys · no accounts · your data stays in your Documents folder"],"features":["Agent-built trips — a new trip starts as a full-screen conversation: Ulisse asks everything it needs in one interactive question carousel (single choice, multi choice or free text — swipe through, answer all, send…","Real hotels from Booking.com — for every night Ulisse runs a live Booking.com search (headless Chrome on your machine, no API keys): real names, real total prices for your exact dates, availability flags, prefilled deep…","Real restaurants from Google Maps — same treatment for food: live Google Maps data (rating, review count, the average per-person price — the \"€20–30\" you see on Maps — category, coordinates), ranked so solid review…","A live notebook — Ulisse takes structured notes after every single answer (enforced at the tool layer, not just prompted) and the notebook card fills in next to the chat in real time; it is re-injected on every turn as…","Trip currency — pick EUR or USD before the first message; every price in the app and in the agent's work uses it (the fuel estimate converts through a daily-refreshed exchange rate)."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Prot10/MyTripPlanner/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"23a9a2dcb5f6ee81b457d86f671ed92c8ef8107497264d6726aef5b9598da9e5","extractedAt":"2026-10-05T19:22:11.316Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-05T19:22:11.316Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Plan road trips by talking. Ulisse — an AI agent running on your own Claude or ChatGPT subscription — interviews you, then builds the whole itinerary live: stops, real roads on the map, timings, budget, real hotels from Booking.com and real restaurants from Google Maps.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Prot10/MyTripPlanner/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"account","status":"documented","text":"Self-hosted · no API keys · no accounts · your data stays in your Documents folder","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Prot10/MyTripPlanner/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"paid_service","status":"required","text":"In-app chat (floating panel over the map on desktop, its own tab on mobile) with two subscription-powered engines: Claude (Agent SDK, Pro/Max login) and Codex (OpenAI Codex CLI, ChatGPT sign-in).","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Prot10/MyTripPlanner/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"In-app chat (floating panel over the map on desktop, its own tab on mobile) with two subscription-powered engines: Claude (Agent SDK, Pro/Max login) and Codex (OpenAI Codex CLI, ChatGPT sign-in).","so